I changed sample data a bit
65 00 10,a
65 00 20,b

case 1 - using stringsAsFactors = FALSE in input format

--------------------------------------------

table1.cols = c("sno","name")

table1.format = make.input.format('csv', 'text', sep=',' , col.names=table1.cols, stringsAsFactors = FALSE )
Mapper <- function(key, columns){
  output.key    = data.frame( sno  = as.character(columns$sno) , name = as.character(columns$name))
  output.value  = data.frame( sno  = as.character(columns$sno) , name = as.character(columns$name))
  keyval( output.key, output.value )
}
> data = from.dfs(table1.data)
> str(data)
List of 2
 $ key:'data.frame': 2 obs. of  2 variables:
  ..$ sno : Factor w/ 2 levels "65 00 10","65 00 20": 1 2
  ..$ name: Factor w/ 2 levels "a","b": 1 2
 $ val:'data.frame': 2 obs. of  2 variables:
  ..$ sno : Factor w/ 2 levels "65 00 10","65 00 20": 1 2
  ..$ name: Factor w/ 2 levels "a","b": 1 2
--------------------------------------------

case 2 - using stringsAsFactors = FALSE while creating data.frame
--------------------------------------------

table1.format = make.input.format('csv', 'text', sep=',' , col.names=table1.cols )
Mapper <- function(key, columns){

  output.key    = data.frame( sno  = as.character(columns$sno) , name = as.character(columns$name), stringsAsFactors = FALSE)
  output.value  = data.frame( sno  = as.character(columns$sno) , name = as.character(columns$name), stringsAsFactors = FALSE)
  keyval( output.key, output.value )
}

> data = from.dfs(table1.data)
> str(data)
List of 2
 $ key:'data.frame': 2 obs. of  2 variables:
  ..$ sno : chr [1:2] "65 00 10" "65 00 20"
  ..$ name: chr [1:2] "a" "b"
 $ val:'data.frame': 2 obs. of  2 variables:
  ..$ sno : chr [1:2] "65 00 10" "65 00 20"
  ..$ name: chr [1:2] "a" "b"
--------------------------------------------

- without using as.character() both cases results into factors
- I am using case 2 as of now
- still working on producing the error I posted in previous post, with sample data I am not able to reproduce it as of now.

hope this helps

